Package: sblr
Type: Package
Title: Experimental Bayesian Genomic Prediction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Sørensen", email = "peter.sorensen@r-qgg.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Experimental methods for Bayesian genomic prediction using
    genome-wide association study summary statistics, sparse linkage
    disequilibrium matrices, and PLINK BED genotype files. Includes
    multi-trait and annotation-informed prior models intended for research
    and method development.
